WEBVTT

00:14.550 --> 00:18.480
Figures. I come out here to
slay the monster I'd heard about,

00:18.510 --> 00:22.020
but there isn't a sign
of anything like it.

00:23.980 --> 00:27.950
What do you expect? It's a hoax.

00:27.980 --> 00:32.990
I bet the peasants panicked when
they came across a fox or a wild dog.

00:33.530 --> 00:36.110
We came out for nothing.

00:40.540 --> 00:43.500
As I thought, not
a single mouse.

00:47.250 --> 00:49.000
Hey, hey, you drunk, man?

00:57.050 --> 00:58.690
Give it to me.

00:58.720 --> 01:01.560
Who is it!? Come out!

01:03.560 --> 01:05.610
Give me your right arm.

01:05.640 --> 01:07.820
So you're the monster!

01:07.850 --> 01:10.240
You shall give me your arm.

01:10.270 --> 01:12.330
What!? Ha!

01:12.360 --> 01:14.360
Let's see if you can get it!

01:17.410 --> 01:19.660
Then I shall have it...

02:53.960 --> 02:58.970
<i>Episode 8 The Fate of Rengoku.</i>

03:04.470 --> 03:07.070
What's the matter? Come on.

03:07.100 --> 03:08.850
Take this!!

03:32.080 --> 03:35.810
Even a samurai who seemed
so strong couldn't make it.

03:35.840 --> 03:40.060
So it's true a monster
does live in Kuresaka Pass.

03:40.090 --> 03:41.810
Heaven protect us.

03:41.840 --> 03:46.690
Sure won't be anyone using
that pass for a long while.

03:46.720 --> 03:49.150
Uh-huh, indeed.

03:49.180 --> 03:51.440
Hey, did you hear that?

03:53.230 --> 03:55.740
A monster. They said a monster.

03:55.770 --> 04:00.190
If we can't use the mountain pass,
we'll have to use the longer route.

04:00.940 --> 04:04.670
Those people's story...
do you think it's true?

04:04.700 --> 04:08.160
Rumors often have a
tendency to be exaggerated.

04:08.200 --> 04:10.720
What are you
gonna do if it is true?

04:10.750 --> 04:11.760
You're scared?

04:11.790 --> 04:13.970
Uh, I'm not scared!

04:14.000 --> 04:16.180
But we're with a woman.

04:16.210 --> 04:17.790
I'll be fine.

04:18.590 --> 04:20.680
Well, uh, you know
what they always say.

04:20.710 --> 04:22.690
Better safe than sorry.

04:22.720 --> 04:25.270
Better safe than sorry?

04:25.300 --> 04:28.110
An unfitting phrase to
come out of your mouth...

04:28.140 --> 04:30.280
But, I suppose you're right.

04:30.310 --> 04:33.390
We'll avoid the mountain pass.

04:38.940 --> 04:45.660
Properly speaking, we should have
been the one to come to you, of course.

04:45.700 --> 04:49.490
However, we are truly honored
to have you, Lord Yamikubo.

04:49.910 --> 04:54.180
That is half of the
Sacred Dragon Stone.

04:54.210 --> 04:56.340
- Yamidoro.
- Yes.

04:56.370 --> 04:59.920
You, too, are aware of my
true intentions, are you not?

04:59.960 --> 05:03.770
To take the vast wealth that will be
revealed with the Sacred Dragon Stone,

05:03.800 --> 05:07.180
and, eventually with the backup of this
wealth, take control of the government.

05:07.720 --> 05:12.180
To accomplish that, your
presenting this half-piece is useless.

05:12.770 --> 05:15.740
Please be assured, my
lord. We are working on it.

05:15.770 --> 05:19.520
We will present you the other
half of the Dragon Stone soon.

05:21.360 --> 05:23.000
Work earnestly. In so doing,

05:23.030 --> 05:26.210
you can expect to be rewarded
adequately for your effort.

05:26.240 --> 05:28.530
I thank you, my lord.

05:36.160 --> 05:39.750
Easy, easy. Now
walk a little more.

05:40.290 --> 05:46.760
Yes. Now don't you go wandering into the
bushes again or I'll get all scratched up.

05:57.690 --> 05:59.980
So you're the monster
that's been rumored about?

06:01.520 --> 06:03.120
I was waiting for you.

06:03.150 --> 06:04.150
What?

06:04.320 --> 06:06.460
Hearing the rumors.

06:06.490 --> 06:09.870
I knew you would
choose the mountain pass.

06:10.620 --> 06:15.450
Jubei. I will absolutely
not let you get away.

06:15.950 --> 06:20.130
I see the rumor about
the monster is true.

06:20.540 --> 06:24.390
I shall at last avenge the
death of my brother, Jyashi.

06:24.420 --> 06:26.020
Your brother?

06:26.050 --> 06:27.720
His death will not be forgotten!

06:35.020 --> 06:39.700
I shall take revenge for the
death of my brother, Jyashi!

06:39.730 --> 06:41.240
Hey, wait.

06:41.270 --> 06:44.830
Ninjas like us take the path of
hell— We either kill or get killed.

06:44.860 --> 06:49.540
You start getting personal with
vengeance fights, you'll ruin your health.

06:49.570 --> 06:51.030
Shut up!

07:13.760 --> 07:15.680
<i>Remember, Rengoku.</i>

07:16.390 --> 07:19.530
<i>You are to bring me back the
remaining piece of the Dragon Stone.</i>

07:19.560 --> 07:22.440
<i>You are not after Jubei's life.</i>

08:20.750 --> 08:24.870
I can't do it. He is
perfectly guarded.

10:39.680 --> 10:42.010
Your determination
is frightening.

10:59.110 --> 11:00.110
Wait.

11:00.490 --> 11:03.170
I am Dakatsu, a Hiruko ninja.

11:03.200 --> 11:06.180
Both the Hiruko and Kimon
clans are after the same

11:06.210 --> 11:08.970
thing; to capture the
Dragon Stone from Jubei.

11:09.000 --> 11:11.450
But it seems that you
are more interested in

11:11.480 --> 11:14.180
killing him rather than
taking the Dragon Stone.

11:14.210 --> 11:16.390
Something about avenging
your brother's death.

11:16.420 --> 11:17.390
How do you know?

11:17.420 --> 11:19.510
I overheard you a
few moments ago.

11:19.970 --> 11:22.400
And? What are you trying to say?

11:22.430 --> 11:24.570
Why don't you team up with me?

11:24.600 --> 11:26.190
With you?

11:26.220 --> 11:29.360
Look. That bear had a mate.

11:29.390 --> 11:32.770
The female probably
came to avenge him.

11:47.240 --> 11:52.390
My stinger contains venom so powerful, it
can even kill a bear with a single strike.

11:52.420 --> 11:55.590
With my poisonous stinger,
Jubei will be defeated.

11:56.170 --> 12:01.470
You can avenge your brother's death
and I get the Dragon Stone. How about it?

12:02.220 --> 12:04.110
I cannot let you have
the Dragon Stone.

12:04.140 --> 12:06.230
You're sure you don't
want to change your mind?

12:06.260 --> 12:09.680
The way of the ninja is to
follow the master's commands.

12:10.350 --> 12:13.360
Alright then, do as you wish.

12:13.390 --> 12:17.440
But, with the way you are now,
you'll never be able to defeat Jubei.

12:58.020 --> 13:02.900
That was close. I
nearly got barbecued.

13:07.820 --> 13:10.670
It's you again.
You're persistent.

13:10.700 --> 13:13.720
You can expect me to
return from the Sanzu.

13:13.750 --> 13:17.080
River as often as
necessary to take your life.

14:18.900 --> 14:21.830
Jubei didn't come after all.

14:21.860 --> 14:24.580
Perhaps he took
the mountain pass.

14:24.610 --> 14:26.160
Hm. Are you worried?

14:26.190 --> 14:29.030
No, not at all.

14:31.160 --> 14:35.500
That fellow has us concerned
whether he's nearby or away.

15:11.910 --> 15:17.540
I can't die yet. Not until I
see to it that Jubei is dead.

15:20.080 --> 15:23.840
Till then, please
wait... Jyashi.

15:34.550 --> 15:36.350
Have you changed your mind?

15:38.930 --> 15:40.610
I shall agree with your terms.

15:40.640 --> 15:42.410
I changed my mind, too.

15:42.440 --> 15:43.600
Huh?

15:43.940 --> 15:46.290
The Dragon Stone
will not be enough.

15:46.320 --> 15:48.120
What else do you want?

15:48.150 --> 15:50.570
Your body.

15:51.150 --> 15:54.840
Look... these ugly limbs.

15:54.870 --> 15:58.800
Everyone shuns me
because of this ugly body.

15:58.830 --> 16:05.180
So... I want your white
arms. I want your limber legs.

16:05.210 --> 16:08.380
Are you willing to
agree to this condition?

16:42.710 --> 16:44.510
I like this.

16:44.540 --> 16:47.210
Now, let's get Jubei.

16:53.260 --> 16:55.180
What?

17:13.610 --> 17:17.380
Arms... my arms!

17:17.410 --> 17:20.700
Help! Please remove these arms!

17:21.450 --> 17:26.790
I beg you. My arms... help!

17:29.750 --> 17:32.930
Legs... Stop!

17:32.960 --> 17:36.010
L-Legs... Legs!

17:37.340 --> 17:41.310
S-Stop! Stop it!!

17:51.730 --> 17:54.080
Keep the limbs.

17:54.110 --> 17:56.200
Forget about the Dragon Stone.

18:10.290 --> 18:13.300
You sure did return
from the Sanzu.

18:15.090 --> 18:18.190
This time you'll be the
one thrown into hell.

18:18.220 --> 18:22.720
But you'll be in the deepest abyss,
where you'll never be able to crawl out.

18:43.580 --> 18:45.910
This will be your end.

18:46.620 --> 18:49.080
The poison will flow
through your body in no time.

18:51.210 --> 18:54.460
Jyashi, I finally
took your revenge!

18:57.880 --> 18:59.590
Guess you're out of luck.

19:01.890 --> 19:06.100
If you would've picked it up
earlier, you could've killed me.

19:06.720 --> 19:08.060
Damn you!

19:14.320 --> 19:16.410
No! Not now!

19:16.440 --> 19:20.210
I can't die now, not until I
take vengeance for Jyashi!

19:20.240 --> 19:23.200
I can't! I CAN'T!

19:34.380 --> 19:37.770
You can no longer operate on yourself
now that you've lost all your arms.

19:37.800 --> 19:41.430
You should live the rest of your
life praying for your brother's soul.

19:51.980 --> 19:54.400
Bye, sister.

19:55.110 --> 19:57.910
Wait, Jubei, where
are you going?

19:57.940 --> 20:01.070
Don't go! Jubei, come back!!

20:01.530 --> 20:06.130
Jubefl Come back!

20:06.160 --> 20:08.210
Come back, Jubei!

20:08.240 --> 20:12.870
Jubefl!

20:33.480 --> 20:37.650
It seems that you've failed to
capture the Dragon Stone, Rengoku.

20:42.240 --> 20:48.050
JyashL... Jyashi... Jyashi!

20:48.080 --> 20:50.510
How pitiful.

20:50.540 --> 20:53.460
Your life is no
longer worth living.

20:54.920 --> 20:55.920
JyashL...

21:00.250 --> 21:01.550
JyashL...

21:05.930 --> 21:08.390
My Jyashi...

21:11.810 --> 21:15.190
Jyashi... Jyashi...

21:15.770 --> 21:17.060
JyashL...

21:17.900 --> 21:19.190
JyashL...

21:22.070 --> 21:23.360
JyashL.

23:29.900 --> 23:31.910
<i>Next Episode.</i>

23:32.820 --> 23:37.210
As Shigure hurries on her journey alone,
the Ura Yagyu clan greets her on the road,

23:37.240 --> 23:39.930
but their intention
was that of ambush.

23:39.960 --> 23:43.100
The mystery of the Light Maiden is
revealed in an unusual turn of events.

23:43.130 --> 23:47.810
What drives Zofu, a Hiruko
Ninja, to challenge Jubei for a duel?

23:47.840 --> 23:50.190
The two ninjas battle
fiercely under the moonlit sky.

23:50.220 --> 23:52.890
And what awaits in the end?

23:53.090 --> 23:56.510
Next on Ninja Scroll:
A Dragon Within.

23:56.930 --> 23:58.070
<i>(Episode!) A Dragon
Within Witness.</i>

23:58.100 --> 24:01.270
<i>(Episode!) A Dragon Within</i>
